                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I first played this game at a convention and spoke with the developers. They spoke about all the ambitious things to come for the game and really created interest. \nI purchased a key from them at the convention. \nThey have not put out a single update since, nor had any communication about what is happening with the game. \nThe website is gone, and for almost four years, there has been no communication. The developers have effectively made off with any money they made and left the game available for anyone to accidentally make an uninformed purchase.\n\nI see this echoed in the reviews already, but I wanted just to say this again as anyone purchasing it at this point will be losing money on a game that is the exact definition of what is wrong with early access. \n\nThis should be removed from Steam.",
